# The Quota (era 2): the era's own senses, for the moments the shared ones in senses.lwd do not cover. The
# device rule, the author 2026-10-23: story reaches the player through weight, sound, touch, bodies and changed
# places, never through a document (design/DEVICE-AUDIT.md section 3; design/device-audit/era2.md). Engine:
# world/senses.mjs. Weighted-devices pass, era 2, 2026-10-23.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the scale and the wedge
@sense q.wedge.find
sound: knock 0.35 under
caption: iron knocking on iron, under the pan
rumble: 0.05 0.8 140
anim: player reach 1.2
camera: push 1.6 1.2
hold: 1

@sense q.wedge.out
sound: creak 0.55 near 1.4
sound: thud 0.3 under
caption: a wedge of iron worked loose from under the pan
rumble: 0.5 0.2 260
rumble: 0.2 0.4 220 300
anim: player stoop 1.5
hold: 1

@sense q.wedge.in
sound: knock 0.5 near
caption: the heel of a hand knocking iron home
rumble: 0.6 0.1 90
rumble: 0.6 0.1 90 200
anim: player stoop 1

# the queue on the square, when the arm comes up and stays up
@sense q.queue.breath
sound: murmur 0.45 far 3
caption: a long breath going out of the whole queue
screen: vignette 0.25 3
camera: hold 2
hold: 1.6

# the queue watching the biscuit go to the inspector's mouth
@sense q.queue.watch
sound: murmur 0.2 far 2
caption: the queue gone quiet
screen: dim 0.15 2.5
hold: 1.2

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the hill
@sense q.rock.cold
screen: tint #c8d8e8 0.2 2.5
sound: breath 0.25 near 2
caption: a breath through the teeth at the cold
rumble: 0.05 0.6 600
anim: player still 2
hold: 1.4

@sense q.goat.push
sound: breath 0.3 near 1.2
caption: a goat breathing hard through its nose
rumble: 0.3 0.05 160
rumble: 0.3 0.05 160 280
anim: player flinch 0.4

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the knots, the cap, the thread, the bowl
@sense q.knots
sound: breath 0.15 near 1.6
caption: wool running through fingers
rumble: 0.05 0.25 90
rumble: 0.05 0.25 90 260
rumble: 0.05 0.25 90 520
rumble: 0.05 0.25 90 780
hold: 0.8

@sense q.cap.hold
sound: breath 0.2 near 1.8
caption: a slow breath
screen: dim 0.18 2.5
rumble: 0.05 0.15 400
camera: push 1.5 1.6
hold: 1.2

@sense q.bowl.lift
sound: bowlset 0.35 near
caption: a bowl lifted off a shelf and put back
rumble: 0.1 0.1 120
hold: 0.8

@sense q.spoon.scrape
sound: spoon 0.45 near 2.4
caption: a spoon scraping an empty bowl
rumble: 0.02 0.2 300
rumble: 0.02 0.2 300 500
hold: 1

@sense q.chalk.goat
sound: knock 0.2 near
caption: chalk on a door
screen: vignette 0.2 2
hold: 0.8

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the clay, the corner
@sense q.clay
sound: drag 0.3 under 1.6
caption: wet clay pulling at a boot
rumble: 0.4 0.05 500
anim: player stoop 1.5

@sense q.spade
sound: thud 0.4 near
sound: drag 0.25 near 1.4
caption: a spade going into frozen clay
rumble: 0.7 0.1 160
rumble: 0.7 0.1 160 900
screen: dim 0.25 3

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the post
@sense q.pole.lift
sound: creak 0.45 near 1.6
caption: the barrier pole swinging up
rumble: 0.2 0.15 500

@sense q.bayonet
sound: snip 0.4 near
caption: a bayonet going into a sack
rumble: 0.05 0.6 80
anim: player flinch 0.5

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the doctor
@sense q.word.said
sound: breath 0.2 near 1.6
caption: someone breathing out after a word is said
screen: dim 0.2 2
camera: hold 1.6
hold: 1.4
